+# Accounts service
+
+Terminology for customer accounts, support work, and bank staff.
+
+## Support cases
+
+**Support case**:
+A customer issue raised against an account and handled by an assigned support user.
+
+**Case resolution**:
+A customer-visible comment explaining how a support case was resolved.
+_Avoid_: internal note, closure reason
+
+**Case assignee**:
+The support user responsible for handling a particular support case.
+_Avoid_: account assignee
