@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Store case resolutions as customer-visible comments
+
+Case closure resolutions are persisted as non-internal case comments authored by the closing staff user, rather than as a field on `support_cases`. This reuses the existing customer-visible conversation history so customers can see how a case was resolved without changing the close response shape.
